{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此三從別節經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約通明義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名本在初，論從後立"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂依經成立七種義句，復由義句成立般若"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "列名對經如後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝文亦足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝上住中十二種障"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對經如前住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通前\n諸住，各有二義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論自釋云：此中見者，謂分別也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂對治彼凡夫不能生如是心，是為邪行對治"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂若生如是心而有執想，是菩\n薩邪行。若論度生，是亦正行。而與見共，故為共見正行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具二對治，始與般若相應"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不失亦云不共，謂不與見共亦不失之義。後文例爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文如\n後引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云菩薩入日光定，上升兜率云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰世親"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即自但應如一所教\n住下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "猶言顯示"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今考其數，亦開合多少不定，如後見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏、唐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云阿僧佉菩薩造，蓋無著梵語云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事如別出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正謂如是等五事，是一經\n之體，由是義身般若流行於世，故佛種不斷，此為相續義句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能覺者理，能說者教，\n\n非必定而後說，蓋寂而常照之義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下正宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於七種義句，除判地立名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如地持中說云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彌勒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "化他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如天親斷疑之釋，蓋亦出此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云鉢提三摩提等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如後論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂涅槃空是不可得義，凡\n彼眾生皆應以涅槃攝取令出生死故。無有過者，亦無過上義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雖難處生，亦有得度時者，或云待時者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂與惑業俱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂未盡苦果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論自注云：行謂五陰\n行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文見前後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通示"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂皆以不著為性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即住相以示不住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我想即初外道等，依止即想無想定，彼根定故且云不轉，故不言之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰：我想、有情想、壽者想、更求趣想。又曰：我想、眾生想、命想、壽者想。所出不同，名想或異。今依\n秦本，且以我、人、眾生、壽者為次為正。偈言壽者等，從後舉爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "委如法界次第，依大論注釋云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文言隨眠，天親對現行麤惑說，即無明也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別譯\n楞伽有此一說，併見於此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十法行未撿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上卷止此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論作聚義有二種，文似未安，亦是文略，應云福聚。文有二義，謂聚、非聚；偈亦二義，謂趣、不趣。以偈配\n經，聚即不趣，趣即非聚，二義而已，故云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至，猶極也。修德之極，必得法身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文仍作安立第一義者，誤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑\n四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上卷止此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘文入後段釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上卷止此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文誤作有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑八上卷止此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑\n十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中卷止此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂五陰相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂法界依報色及修得果色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正言由第\n一義空智力故，不為世智顛倒轉故在先也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中卷止此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文見魏譯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若加\n此段，自為一疑，則當十八。今依秦本，亦且從畧。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑十九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如前引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑二十"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑二十一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故\n阿耨菩提"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○是故說不受福德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○無著以此段連上云云，天親以此文屬下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云。斷疑二十二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑二十\n三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初二翻名止觀，故能知能見。第三恐取等持之義，故以三摩提\n為言。若準圓覺，則初名奢摩他，〔故〕名三摩鉢提。第三名禪那。今次名異彼，即同涅槃。第三合名優畢叉。今言三\n摩提者，名相進退所出不同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷疑二十四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云\n云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文煩不盡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○斷疑二十五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "加一略四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
